#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0533 expect=violation domain=DM
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when the Planned Repro Path Code (RPATHCD) variable is present in the Demographics (DM) dataset; RPATHCD is not used in human clinical trials.
#note "The RPATHCD column is present in DM, so the rule fires"
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1
dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col RPATHCD type=Char label="Reproductive Path Code"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015 |
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1023 |
---
